# Implementation Plan - CFO Bot

## Goal Description
Build a calculator agent (CFO Bot) that estimates monthly cloud costs of a Chat Bot application based on usage assumptions and model selection. The app will be deployed to Google Firebase.

## Proposed Changes
We will create a Vite + React frontend application with visually stunning Vanilla CSS to meet the premium aesthetic requirement.
The application will consist of:

### Frontend App 
#### [NEW] src/components/Calculator.jsx
Contains the main logic and sliders for UI inputs (MAU, Messages per user, token counts).
#### [NEW] src/components/ResultsDashboard.jsx
Displays the cost breakdown prominently using responsive cards and visual components.
#### [NEW] src/utils/pricingModels.js
Contains the exact mathematical cost models and constant rates for different AI models and cloud services.
#### [NEW] src/tests/pricingModels.test.js
Contains the unit tests (Vitest) confirming mathematically flawless cost calculations.
#### [NEW] src/App.jsx
The main container arranging the Calculator and ResultsDashboard inside a premium layout.
#### [NEW] index.css
Contains the styling leveraging modern, premium design aesthetics (dark mode by default, glassmorphism, dynamic animations, tailored colors).

## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- `npm run test`: We will use Vitest to strictly test the mathematical formulas in `src/utils/pricingModels.js`.
- Tests will follow the rules set out in `test_specifications.md`.

### Manual Verification
- Run `npm run dev` to verify the UI loads and is highly responsive and aesthetically pleasing.
- Slide values around to ensure real-time cost feedback logic is fully functional.
- Deploy to Firebase Hosting and test live URL.
